 "insight": [
  "The main partners for Luxembourg's vehicle exports in 2025 are Germany, France, and Belgium.",
  "Total vehicle exports amount to 1.67 billion euros, with the top three partners accounting for 66.1% of exports.",
  "Germany is the largest partner with 461.5 million euros (27.6%), followed by France with 425.1 million euros (25.4%) and Belgium with 218.6 million euros (13.1%).",
  "The remaining exports are distributed among the Netherlands, Italy, other countries, and a small undisclosed portion.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
